  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/17/45/060" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">17.45.060  Authority.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>The City Administrator is authorized to enter into an intergovernmental agreement with TriMet to govern procedures in the issuance of permits under this Section.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-463f81bcb6f3bb0e034d2a6ebdee755b798b1992ea9e1f356298128b86307d00">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-44a33395379c2a5fad3406167f306be095afdc7734cd64ef3c6f5c0f4aa100e2">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
