  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/17/96/080" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">17.96.080 Prior Grades Not Affected.  </span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p>The establishment of a fixed base to which all grade elevations are referred as outlined in this Chapter will in no way affect the validity of grades or any improvements carried out prior to such establishment.</p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-3b655a35cbd0fae160fced4fd1ff0a69fc91332e8d9589c0e5ac00009be39a50">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
